        "left": "CAPTAIN SIDE",
        "right": "F/O SIDE",
        "locate": "Between the two seats. From the front: the forward electronic panel (P9) with the CDUs, just below the main panel; the control stand with the thrust levers, at hand height; then the aft electronic panel (P8) by your knees, with the fire handles, radios and transponder."
      },
